.TH "CODEX-MASTER-MCP" "1" "2026-08-14" "codex-master 0.10.5" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
codex-master-mcp \- control the local Codex Agentinnen fleet and expose its MCP server
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B codex-master-mcp
.RI [ options ]
.I command
.RI [ command-options ]
.PP
.B python3 -m codex_master.server
.RI [ options ]
.I command
.RI [ command-options ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B codex-master-mcp
is the command-line and MCP entry point for the local codex-master fleet.
It manages sleeping Codex Agentinnen, assignments, leases, account-aware model
selection, registry-backed provider series, and read-only Hive control-plane
diagnostics.
.PP
The repository wrapper at
.B bin/codex-master-mcp
sets
.B PYTHONPATH
to the repository's
.B src
directory and executes the Python module.  A package installation exposes the
same entry point through the
.B codex-master-mcp
console script.
.PP
Run
.B codex-master-mcp COMMAND --help
for command-specific arguments.  Commands that mutate sessions, homes,
registries, plugin state, or external providers require explicit authority and
their own safety gates.
.SH SECURITY MODEL
Public command and MCP responses are data-sparse.  Raw prompts, raw model
responses, secrets, authentication files, absolute private paths, and
unbounded logs must not be returned.
.PP
Agent selection and lifecycle operations fail closed when authority, account
availability, resource counts, scope, lease ownership, or required runtime
state cannot be established.  A spawn offer is advisory, short-lived, and does
not reserve capacity.  Starting an Agentin performs admission again under the
runtime lock.
.PP
Only the authorized Queen may restart or reload Masterjet, install it, or
synchronize its plugin cache.  Other callers may inspect status and provide a
verified recommendation, but must not perform those lifecycle actions.
.SH AGENT SELECTION
Start and assignment commands share the central class, lifecycle, model, and
reasoning resolver.  Explicit requests are accepted only inside class,
lifecycle, capability, availability, cost, and reasoning bounds.  A rejected
request returns the effective fallback and reason codes.
.PP
The first selection round should use the MCP tool
.B agent_selection_options
for the concrete target Agentin.  Its response contains only currently allowed
classes, lifecycles, models, reasoning levels, and valid tuples.  The response
generation may be supplied as
.B known_generation
on the next read-only query.
.PP
The accepted lifecycle spellings include
.BR ephemeral ,
.BR invocation ,
.BR binding ,
and
.BR persistent .
.B invocation
is an input alias for
.BR ephemeral .
.SH COMMANDS
.SS Agent lifecycle
.TP
.B start
Start selected Agentinnen through the shared resolver and admission path.
.TP
.B spawn-offers
Return short-lived resource-aware spawn offers without reserving capacity.
.TP
.B status
Return structured, data-sparse status for selected Agentinnen.
.TP
.B wait
Wait briefly for activity, stop, or a classified limit.
.TP
.B watchdog
Run a bounded watchdog check for selected Agentinnen.
.TP
.B usage-watchdog
Inspect usage state without returning raw provider output.
.TP
.B send
Send bounded input to a leased Agentin.
.TP
.B interrupt
Interrupt a leased Agentin.
.TP
.B stop
Stop selected Agentinnen through guarded lifecycle handling.
.TP
.B lease-status
Inspect lease ownership and expiry.
.TP
.B claim
Claim an Agentin lease when policy permits it.
.TP
.B release
Release an owned Agentin lease.
.TP
.B tail
Return a bounded, redacted activity excerpt.
.SS Assignment and capability inspection
.TP
.B assign
Create an assignment with explicit role, scope, lifecycle, model, and reasoning
inputs.
.TP
.BR assign-readonly , " " assign-live-data , " " assign-write
Create role-specific assignments with stricter predefined write policies.
.TP
.BR assignments , " " last-assignment , " " assignment-report
List assignment metadata or return a bounded report.
.TP
.BR report-request , " " worktree-create , " " worktree-status
Request a report or manage an assignment-scoped worktree under the applicable
authority checks.
.TP
.BR skills , " " skill-match , " " capabilities , " " scope-check
Inspect bounded skill, capability, and scope metadata.
.TP
.B routing-decision
Inspect the account-aware route selected for an Agentin and role.
.SS Selection policy
.TP
.BR selector-policy , " " selection-policy-status
Inspect selector and account-aware selection policy state.
.TP
.BR selector-preview , " " selection-preview
Preview selection without reserving or starting an Agentin.
.TP
.B selection-status
Show read-only Selection service status.
.SS Fleet and recovery
.TP
.B fleet
Manage the versioned fleet registry, accounts, provider models, series, Gemini
plans, Ollama diagnostics, and related read-only or guarded mutation commands.
Use
.B codex-master-mcp fleet --help
for its subcommands.
.TP
.BR fleet-recovery-status , " " fleet-recovery-retry
Inspect recovery journal state or retry an eligible recovery action.
.TP
.B pool
Validate, install, inspect, copy authentication into, or destroy a managed
Agentinnen pool.  Destructive subcommands require their explicit confirmation
and target checks.
.SS Integration and diagnostics
.TP
.BR integration-status , " " commit-ready-check
Inspect integration evidence without committing or publishing changes.
.TP
.BR app-bridge-status , " " plugin-status , " " namespace-status
Inspect application bridge, plugin, and namespace state.
.TP
.BR release-status , " " watchdog-status , " " timeout-policy
Inspect release, supervisor, and timeout policy state.
.TP
.BR control-center , " " control-center-launch
Inspect or launch the local control-center surface when available.
.TP
.BR applet-status , " " applet-action
Inspect or operate the Cinnamon adapter under its bounded interface.
.TP
.B doctor
Run structured diagnostics without exposing raw output.
.TP
.B tools
Print the MCP tool catalog as JSON.
.SS Hive control plane
.TP
.B hive
Validate or inspect the Hive control plane.  DP and SP scheduling remain
separate and mutation stays gated.
.TP
.B reset-anchor-run
Plan a passive reset anchor without executing it unless the command's explicit
gate permits execution.
.SS Installation
.TP
.B install
Install the MCP/plugin integration.  This mutates local registration and plugin
state and is reserved for the authorized Queen under current policy.
.TP
.B uninstall
Remove the installed MCP integration through the guarded uninstall path.
.SH MANPAGE BUILD AND INSTALL
Build deterministic compressed output without installing it:
.PP
.nf
\&./scripts/codex-master-manpage build --output-dir /tmp/codex-master-man
.fi
.PP
Install to the default user prefix
.BR ~/.local :
.PP
.nf
\&./scripts/codex-master-manpage install
.fi
.PP
Verify the installed regular file, mode, and content:
.PP
.nf
\&./scripts/codex-master-manpage verify
.fi
.PP
For isolated packaging or tests, pass an absolute
.B --prefix
to
.B install
and
.BR verify .
The resulting file is
.BR PREFIX/share/man/man1/codex-master-mcp.1.gz .
The installer refuses symlinks in its managed target path.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BR -h , " " --help
Show top-level help.  Place
.B --help
after a command to inspect that command's arguments.
.SH EXIT STATUS
.TP
.B 0
Command completed successfully.
.TP
.B non-zero
Validation, authority, availability, safety, runtime, or command execution
failed.  Mutating commands must leave denied operations unapplied.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B HOME
Provides the default user-local prefix and runtime home locations.
.TP
.B PYTHONPATH
The repository wrapper prepends the repository's
.B src
directory before running the Python module.
.SH FILES
.TP
.B man/man1/codex-master-mcp.1
Canonical repository source for this manual page.
.TP
.B ~/.local/share/man/man1/codex-master-mcp.1.gz
Default user-local installed manual page.
.TP
.B codex-agent-classes.json
Versioned Agentinnen class policy catalog.
.TP
.B codex-model-policy.json
Versioned model and reasoning policy catalog.
.TP
.B codex-fleet-registry.json
Versioned fleet series and account-reference registry.  Secrets are stored
separately.
.SH EXAMPLES
Inspect top-level commands:
.PP
.nf
codex-master-mcp --help
.fi
.PP
Request one advisory spawn offer:
.PP
.nf
codex-master-mcp spawn-offers --required-slots 1
.fi
.PP
Inspect plugin state without changing it:
.PP
.nf
codex-master-mcp plugin-status
.fi
.PP
Render the repository manpage locally:
.PP
.nf
groff -man -Tutf8 man/man1/codex-master-mcp.1
.fi
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR codex (1),
.BR tmux (1),
.BR groff (1),
.BR gzip (1)
.SH BUGS
Report defects through the codex-master project issue tracker.  Do not include
authentication files, provider secrets, raw prompts, or raw model output.
